# rapid-skyrealms on the Trading Post (skyrealms_spawn, rapid-core's minecraft:overworld; the
# rapid-core profile next door). Positions come from the map itself (its region files); fine-tune
# in-game with /skyrealms here (prints a copyable line) and /skyrealms reload, then put the
# final values here, or the next `rsdeploy.py apply` puts these back.

# NPCs in a ring round the compass rose (centre 28.5 -29.5, floor y 149), about seven blocks
# out: inside the twelve oak pillars, clear of the rose's wool border. Each faces the rose;
# they turn to look at players nearby. Players spawn on the rose facing west, so the two in
# front come first: the Island Keeper (/is) front right, the Merchant (/shop) front left. Then
# the Realm Warden to the north and the Expedition Captain to the south; behind, the Route
# Master and the way back to the lobby.
npcs.island.location: "minecraft:overworld, 22.5, 150, -33.5, -56, 0"
